  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional Forum on &quot;Accelerating Food Systems Transformation in the Arab Region#</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The regional Regional Forum on &quot;Accelerating Food Systems Transformation in the Arab Region#, scheduled to take place on 30-31 October, 2024, in Jordan aims to establish a platform for discussing opportunities to enhance Arab food systems transformation through good governance, means of implementation, and regional collaboration. These discussions will serve as preparation for the Food Systems Summit +4, taking place in 2025 in Rome.</narrative>
  </description>
